          "publisher": "South Coast AQMD",
          "retrieved": "2026-10-28",
          "archive_url": "http://web.archive.org/web/20260223115343/https://www.aqmd.gov/docs/default-source/fenceline_monitoring/project_1/fluxsense_scaqmd2015_project1_finalreport(040717).pdf",
          "archive_note": "Wayback availability 2026-10-28 fant et øyeblikksbilde."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
